<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19661" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">glŏbŭlus</span></b> , i,
			m.
		dim.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				little ball</i>, <i>a globule</i> (post-Aug. and
			very rare). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: (chrysocollae) globulis sudore
				resolutis,
			<i><span class="en">Plin. 33,
				5, 27, § 89</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Esp. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b>
			<i>a lump</i> of food, <i>dumpling</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 79</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 5, § 107</span></i>
			Müll.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b> Med. t. t., <i>a pill</i>, <i><span class="en">Scrib. 13
				al.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, of speech, <i>a
			rounding</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">melliti verborum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Petr. 1</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Latin Dictionary</u>
        </u> (Charlton T. Lewis, Charles Short, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1879) </div>
</div>